{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/aa261c92aa6ed6dd8c40098939240d6b.poster.avif?t=1757922604\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/aa261c92aa6ed6dd8c40098939240d6b.webm?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/aa261c92aa6ed6dd8c40098939240d6b.mp4?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shantytown</strong> is a cozy \u201cdiorama builder\u201d where you piece together <strong>dense urban environments </strong>in an enchanting world, one object at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/2f7f245fa4ec20a68a19060fffb75ebb.poster.avif?t=1757922604\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/2f7f245fa4ec20a68a19060fffb75ebb.webm?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/2f7f245fa4ec20a68a19060fffb75ebb.mp4?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a surveyor tasked with building and photographing <strong>20 different locations</strong>. Each location provides a unique set of objects to work with, but it\u2019s up to you to decide where they will go. Larger objects, like buildings, can be upgraded by providing <strong>light</strong>, <strong>utility</strong>, and <strong>decor</strong> objects to them. Optional objectives can be completed to unlock new objects in the creative mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/705e53a3503094b9d593f5972caedb9a.poster.avif?t=1757922604\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/705e53a3503094b9d593f5972caedb9a.webm?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/705e53a3503094b9d593f5972caedb9a.mp4?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are finished with a location, <strong>take a photo</strong> of it to add to your dossier and move on to your next blank canvas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/ca4d8da695c343c4145c0dc25ab13448.poster.avif?t=1757922604\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/ca4d8da695c343c4145c0dc25ab13448.webm?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/ca4d8da695c343c4145c0dc25ab13448.mp4?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location has its own distinct look and feel - you might be building at a floating tea shop ferry terminal, a nightlife district nestled in a transit pipeline, or a mountain-top temple bathhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about the settlements in this semi-futuristic world as you move through it at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/1ac023fc75af6378b1bccb6f1ce6d9d8.avif?t=1757922604\" width=616 height=118 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/a05e896bc89e1ea70fa49197e335a61a.poster.avif?t=1757922604\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/a05e896bc89e1ea70fa49197e335a61a.webm?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/a05e896bc89e1ea70fa49197e335a61a.mp4?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shantytown is a solo-developer project inspired by my love for densely-built cities around the world. You will be encouraged to build vertically, fill small gaps or alleys with utilities and details, and creatively place items like light sources to cover more area. Just like when you\u2019re packing a bag, there\u2019s always room for one more thing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/462c1fe0610d54ddda8266b77941a599.avif?t=1757922604\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/7274c73e374043422329c56b84b3f044.poster.avif?t=1757922604\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/7274c73e374043422329c56b84b3f044.webm?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/7274c73e374043422329c56b84b3f044.mp4?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has its own twist and set of objects, from food trucks and bus stops, to smokestacks or neon signs, you'll be <strong>creating urban environments with <i>character!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most importantly, <strong>build your own way</strong>. This is a casual game and there are no wrong answers. Be creative and construct your own virtual urban diorama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the pillars of gameplay here is creativity and freedom of expression. Developing organically growing dense city blocks in a natural and realistic way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, share your creations with others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/62ef82b44dfc796f37cff95526a98420.avif?t=1757922604\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build compact urban dioramas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand crafted selection of objects at every map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover each location's purpose as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional goals for direction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 unique locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing scenery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradual sandbox mode unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discoverable secret objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at your own pace</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2434600?t=1757922604","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757922604","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/7c8721cc7a9cda451a8f8d45832efff57c04e117/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757922604","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/7c8721cc7a9cda451a8f8d45832efff57c04e117/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757922604","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3701340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/aa261c92aa6ed6dd8c40098939240d6b.poster.avif?t=1757922604\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/aa261c92aa6ed6dd8c40098939240d6b.webm?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/aa261c92aa6ed6dd8c40098939240d6b.mp4?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shantytown</strong> is a cozy \u201cdiorama builder\u201d where you piece together <strong>dense urban environments </strong>in an enchanting world, one object at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/2f7f245fa4ec20a68a19060fffb75ebb.poster.avif?t=1757922604\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/2f7f245fa4ec20a68a19060fffb75ebb.webm?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/2f7f245fa4ec20a68a19060fffb75ebb.mp4?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a surveyor tasked with building and photographing <strong>20 different locations</strong>. Each location provides a unique set of objects to work with, but it\u2019s up to you to decide where they will go. Larger objects, like buildings, can be upgraded by providing <strong>light</strong>, <strong>utility</strong>, and <strong>decor</strong> objects to them. Optional objectives can be completed to unlock new objects in the creative mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/705e53a3503094b9d593f5972caedb9a.poster.avif?t=1757922604\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/705e53a3503094b9d593f5972caedb9a.webm?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/705e53a3503094b9d593f5972caedb9a.mp4?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are finished with a location, <strong>take a photo</strong> of it to add to your dossier and move on to your next blank canvas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/ca4d8da695c343c4145c0dc25ab13448.poster.avif?t=1757922604\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/ca4d8da695c343c4145c0dc25ab13448.webm?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/ca4d8da695c343c4145c0dc25ab13448.mp4?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location has its own distinct look and feel - you might be building at a floating tea shop ferry terminal, a nightlife district nestled in a transit pipeline, or a mountain-top temple bathhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about the settlements in this semi-futuristic world as you move through it at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/1ac023fc75af6378b1bccb6f1ce6d9d8.avif?t=1757922604\" width=616 height=118 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/a05e896bc89e1ea70fa49197e335a61a.poster.avif?t=1757922604\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/a05e896bc89e1ea70fa49197e335a61a.webm?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/a05e896bc89e1ea70fa49197e335a61a.mp4?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shantytown is a solo-developer project inspired by my love for densely-built cities around the world. You will be encouraged to build vertically, fill small gaps or alleys with utilities and details, and creatively place items like light sources to cover more area. Just like when you\u2019re packing a bag, there\u2019s always room for one more thing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/462c1fe0610d54ddda8266b77941a599.avif?t=1757922604\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/7274c73e374043422329c56b84b3f044.poster.avif?t=1757922604\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/7274c73e374043422329c56b84b3f044.webm?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/7274c73e374043422329c56b84b3f044.mp4?t=1757922604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has its own twist and set of objects, from food trucks and bus stops, to smokestacks or neon signs, you'll be <strong>creating urban environments with <i>character!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most importantly, <strong>build your own way</strong>. This is a casual game and there are no wrong answers. Be creative and construct your own virtual urban diorama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the pillars of gameplay here is creativity and freedom of expression. Developing organically growing dense city blocks in a natural and realistic way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, share your creations with others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/62ef82b44dfc796f37cff95526a98420.avif?t=1757922604\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build compact urban dioramas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand crafted selection of objects at every map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover each location's purpose as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional goals for direction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 unique locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing scenery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradual sandbox mode unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discoverable secret objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at your own pace</p></li></ul>","developers":["Erik Rempen"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/b3f538483357f0b690edb890032776d51d82f8c1/header.jpg?t=1757922604","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2434600/272157977/d1f528dc23fb1729ed629c2a3defb218a0f077db/1750918690/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749224788","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2434600/272157977/d1f528dc23fb1729ed629c2a3defb218a0f077db/1750918690/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749224788","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2434600/272157977/d1f528dc23fb1729ed629c2a3defb218a0f077db/1750918690/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749224788","id":257152206,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152206/movie480.mp4?t=1749224788","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152206/movie_max.mp4?t=1749224788"},"name":"Demo Launch","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152206/d2b97ffd02ff1cf960134b6f1656ceb76e0eab22/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749224788","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.co